  headline: Princess Out for Revenge
  article: 'Princess Woodsong, who apparently has been captured for six months, has
    grown tired of waiting for rescue.


    She was broken out by a band of befriended
    woodland creatures, who she has trained into a deadly miltia. Now, reports indicate
    she''s out for revenge against the town for forgetting about her.


    Our correspondent
    from GuildCo. has reached out to clarify the situation: <i>"We think her ransom
    note got caught in our spam filter."</i>'
